 {error&&!modal&&<div role="alert" className="error">{error}{error.includes('Sign in')&&<a href="/login" target="_top"> Sign in</a>}</div>}
 <details className="page-help"><summary>How to use this page</summary><p>{({Exceptions:'Review flagged attendance, confirm the actual times, and request a correction. Only administrator approval changes an attendance record.',Notifications:access.role==='administrator'?'Open each worker request and choose Accept or Decline. Accepted workers become available for face enrollment and attendance.':'Track whether your submitted workers are pending, accepted, or declined.',Overview:'Start by adding a site, then workers. Use the quick actions below for your daily work.',Attendance:'1. Add a worker and assign a site. 2. Use Record attendance for manual time-in or time-out. For face enrollment, open Face recognition and follow the camera instructions.',Materials:'1. Add a material and its current quantity. 2. Choose Record delivery / usage whenever stock changes. Delivery and Return add stock; Issue, Damage, and Loss subtract stock.','Site evidence':'Choose Upload photo, select the site, attach a picture, and add a short description. You can also link the photo to a material transaction.',Reports:'Select the site and attendance date below, then download a report. CSV files open in Excel or Google Sheets. Use Print summary for a PDF.','Staff & permissions':'Choose an auditor to assign their sites. Use Team accounts to reset a forgotten password or manage access.',Settings:'Use Add site to register a construction project. Each worker, material, and photo belongs to a site.'} as Record<string,string>)[page]}</p></details>
